@startuml organization-agentic-realization-boundary
title Organization / Agentic Organization Realization Boundary ; per ADR-ES-020 section 1 + section 2 + section 3

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Organization" as O
class "Agentic Organization" as AO
class "Material Agentic Organizational Behavior" as MAOB

O <|-- AO : specializes
AO *-- MAOB : material-evidence

class "Delegated Intent Interpretation" as DII
class "Contextual Interpretation" as CI
class "Dynamic Organizational Decisions" as DOD
class "Action Selection" as AS
class "Coordination" as Coord
class "Adaptation" as Adp
class "Exception Interpretation" as EI
class "Organizational Escalation" as OE

MAOB --> DII
MAOB --> CI
MAOB --> DOD
MAOB --> AS
MAOB --> Coord
MAOB --> Adp
MAOB --> EI
MAOB --> OE

note bottom of MAOB
  Material agentic organizational behavior requires substantive
  evidence in one or more of the listed dimensions per
  ADR-ES-020 section 3.
end note

@enduml
